      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 3.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Hello, come in. Mind the step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.35,
      "end_seconds": 12.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.95,
      "end_seconds": 14.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.64,
      "end_seconds": 29.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.96,
      "text": "Hmm, mainly bright red blood on the paper. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.29,
      "end_seconds": 34.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.81,
      "end_seconds": 38.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.36,
      "end_seconds": 42.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.03,
      "end_seconds": 52.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "Let me think, it's been two weeks now. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.3,
      "end_seconds": 56.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I follow. Have you had discomfort when sitting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.85,
      "end_seconds": 60.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.13,
      "end_seconds": 65.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "A few quick ones: severe pain, black stools, dizziness or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.95,
      "end_seconds": 70.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.15,
      "end_seconds": 76.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.21,
      "end_seconds": 79.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.01,
      "end_seconds": 82.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.22,
      "end_seconds": 89.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.71,
      "end_seconds": 101.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.71,
      "end_seconds": 115.82,
      "duration_seconds": 12.11,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.13,
      "end_seconds": 120.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.31,
      "end_seconds": 123.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Yes, low haemoglobin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.72,
      "end_seconds": 127.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.63,
      "end_seconds": 131.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Um, no, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.62,
      "end_seconds": 143.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.58,
      "end_seconds": 155.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.08,
      "end_seconds": 182.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 74, temp 36.8 degrees, blood pressure 116 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.58,
      "end_seconds": 189.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.85,
      "end_seconds": 193.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.74,
      "end_seconds": 198.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.41,
      "end_seconds": 203.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.21,
      "end_seconds": 228.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "There is a small soft lump at the edge of the anus and no tear that I can see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.34,
      "end_seconds": 236.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.16,
      "end_seconds": 273.85,
      "duration_seconds": 26.69,
      "text": "I want a blood count done, that's for rectal bleeding. I'm sending you for a camera test of the bowel because of rectal bleeding. I'm going to put you on haemorrhoid cream, twice a day, for a week. It's for haemorrhoids. Fibre, plenty of water, and don't sit on the toilet for long. The colorectal clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.06,
      "end_seconds": 285.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the bleeding gets heavier or you feel faint, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.96,
      "end_seconds": 288.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.4,
      "end_seconds": 295.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Book a review after the camera test. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.44,
      "end_seconds": 299.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.41,
      "end_seconds": 302.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
